{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "一瞬之间脑海中闪过平安夜的经历。", "steam": "一瞬间，平安夜的回忆闪过脑海。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.786}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……虽然确实是想和你多待一会，\\n　但是我们还是得顾着点家里人」", "steam": "“……虽然想在一起，但是过年还是得好好珍惜跟家人相处的时间。”"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.423}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我立马摆出防御态势。\\n大过年的，我可不想吃苦头。", "steam": "我立刻压下冲动。我可不想新年一开始就有痛苦的回忆。"}, "length": {"chs": 25, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.4}
