{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6835", "steam": "sn6835", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯，那就这先这样，去新年参拜吧。\\n　逛个小摊的时间还是有的吧？」", "steam": "“嗯，总之去新年参拜吧！至少逛一下摊贩是OK吧？”"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.468}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「当然，那也是新年参拜的乐趣之一呢」", "steam": "“嗯，那也是新年参拜的重点呢。”"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.667}
